WEBVTT

00:01:28.566 --> 00:01:32.673
the Soviets that his nation had the better rockets.

00:01:32.673 --> 00:01:37.145
But Kennedy's own words at Rice University in 1962

00:01:37.145 --> 00:01:39.043
provide a better clue.

00:01:39.043 --> 00:01:41.566
(Video) John F. Kennedy: But why, some say, the moon?

00:01:41.566 --> 00:01:44.510
Why choose this as our goal?

00:01:44.510 --> 00:01:46.433
And they may well ask,

00:01:46.433 --> 00:01:49.012
why climb the highest mountain?

00:01:49.012 --> 00:01:53.028
Why, 35 years ago, fly the Atlantic?

00:01:53.028 --> 00:01:55.212
Why does Rice play Texas?

00:01:55.212 --> 00:01:57.823
We choose to go to the moon.

00:01:57.823 --> 00:02:00.400
We choose to go to the moon.